And the brass?

MALIK
Stays where it is.

KAI
The inner door?

MALIK
No.

KAI
And if waiting is the problem?

MALIK
Then we find out what nine days ago was before we make another decision blind.

Kai looks at the missed date.

Then at Malik.

Ade takes the scrap with the missed date from Malik's hand.

Malik looks at him.

