Can you move it?

Kai tries.

Nothing.

Behind Malik --

one unresolved articulation occupies the same apparent space as Kai's shoulder.

No strike.

No impact.

Kai convulses.

Sensation returns all at once.

His fingers claw the tile.

Malik starts to turn.

