# SEQUENCE 15 - THE WESTERN STONES

EXT. WESTERN SERVICE TRACK - LATE AFTERNOON

Bode's aging pickup stops at a locked irrigation gate. Beyond it, an old pump clearing and the maintained footpath toward the western stones.

The truck cannot fit through the gate. Beyond it, the footpath disappears into the trees.

