EXT. WESTERN BOUNDARY PATH - LATER

Bode keeps to the path. The brothers follow.

The first boundary stone wears three layers of red binding. Beneath them, a much older copper line disappears underground toward the house.

Malik compares Solomon's map to the angle of the stone.

