# SEQUENCE 16 - THE WORKING POSITION

INT. OKU FAMILY HOUSE - KITCHEN - EVENING

Eno changes the cloth beneath the broken brass half without handling it. The old Vancouver carving remains separately wrapped in Kai's camera bag.

